# Secrets

- A secret comes from fnox (the macOS Keychain) or from the 1Password CLI
  (`op`).
- Give a secret to a command with `fnox exec` or `op run`. The command gets the
  secret in its environment only.
- Never print a secret, never write it to a file, and never put it in the chat.
- If a secret is missing, tell the user. Do not ask the user to type it in the
  chat.
